    lsm:documentation "A residential development area that could be comprised of any combination of multifamily and single family structures and may include mixed land use such as commercial. A project refers to an organized development in which shared common areas, road ways and management structures exist. Project management and individual homeowner associations may also co-exist within the project." ;
