    lsm:documentation "Claims against, limitation on, or liability against real property held by someone other than the fee owner. Encumbrances include liens, deed restrictions, covenants, easements, encroachments, and licenses. An encumbrance can restrict the owner's ability to transfer title to the property or lessen its value." ;
