lsm:resource-fa89fb99f81dde121f6dfa9f648aaafb3675113128fdefc28fb2c0f580c5d18a a lsm:AttributeDeclaration ;
    lsm:documentation "lang (as an attribute name) denotes an attribute whose value is a language code for the natural language of the content of any element; its value is inherited. This name is reserved by virtue of its definition in the XML specification. Notes Attempting to install the relevant ISO 2- and 3-letter codes as the enumerated possible values is probably never going to be a realistic possibility. See BCP 47 at http://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/bcp/bcp47.txt and the IANA language subtag registry at http://www.iana.org/assignments/language-subtag-registry for further information. The union allows for the 'un-declaration' of xml:lang with the empty string." ;
    lsm:inline_simple_type lsm:resource-f0fc42c4796cd4cdbfac84aab1fb77fd8b856d4409464082a0b41fd74966be48 ;
